Apli Design Guide\
\
## Typography\
\
Use Nunito Sans exclusively unless otherwise instructed.\
\
- **Title**: Nunito Sans - Bold 40px [48px line height]\
- **Subtitle**: Nunito Sans - Regular 20px [24px line height]\
- **Important**: Nunito Sans - Bold 16px [24px line height]\
- **Body**: Nunito Sans - Regular 16px [24px line height]\
- **Small**: Nunito Sans - Regular 12px [24px line height]\
\
\
## Color Palette\
\
### Neutral\
\
- Black: `#000000`\
- Dark Grey: `#666666`\
- Grey: `#CCCCCC`\
- Light Grey: `#F2F2F2`\
- White: `#FFFFFF`\
\
\
### Primary\
\
- Turquoise: `#33FFEB`\
- Blue: `#33ADFF`\
- Azure: `#3347FF`\
- Purple: `#8533FF`\
\
\
### Additional\
\
- Green: `#33FF85`\
- Red: `#FF3347`\
- Magenta: `#EB33FF`\
- Pink: `#FF33AD`\
\
\
## Buttons\
\
- **Primary buttons**: Black background (`#000000`), white text (`#FFFFFF`)\
- **Secondary buttons**: White background (`#FFFFFF`), black outline (`#000000`), black text (`#000000`)\
- **Tertiary buttons**: Transparent background, black text (`#000000`)\
\
\
## Text\
\
- Default to black text (`#000000`) and white background.\
- Use white text (`#FFFFFF`) to enhance contrast against dark backgrounds or for readability (e.g., Purple background)\
\
\
## Accent and Functional Colors\
\
- **Azure** (`#3347FF`): Primary accent color\
- **Blue** (`#33ADFF`): Selection indicator\
- **Purple** (`#8533FF`): Error states, or indicating a discarded candidate\
- **Turquoise** (`#33FFEB`): Stage completion indicators\
- **Teal**: Custom states, i.e., for candidates sent to pool\
- **Green** (`#33FF85`): Success states\
\
\
All other colors should be used sparingly and intentionally.\
\
## Corner Styling\
\
- Never use rounded corners\'97always sharp corners!\
\
\
## Modals\
\
Modals should follow these guidelines:\
\
- **Modal Title**: Nunito Sans Bold, 40px, Line-height: 48px\
- **Instructions/Description**: Nunito Sans Regular, 16px, Line-height: 24px\
- **Input Fields**: Sharp corners, grey border (`#CCCCCC`)\
- **Buttons**:\
\
- Primary action: Black background (`#000000`), white text (`#FFFFFF`)\
- Secondary action: White background (`#FFFFFF`), black border (`#000000`), black text (`#000000`)\
- Cancel action: No background, black text (`#000000`)\
\
\
- **Layout**: Clear hierarchy with adequate spacing between elements\
- **Required Fields**: Marked with an asterisk (*)\
\
\
## Containers and Sections\
\
- Boxes or sections with colored backgrounds should not have an outline unless specifically directed\
- Do not use color outlines unless specified}